vta-buildathon-starter

This project is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Portions are adapted from the `examples/buildathon-vta` kit in
verifiable-trust-infrastructure (https://github.com/OpenVTC/verifiable-trust-infrastructure,
Apache-2.0): docker-compose.yml, vta-entrypoint.sh, the scripts in scripts/ and
the client in packages/vta-client. The consumer pipeline in
templates/inbox-verifier follows the usage documented in
dtgwg-trust-tasks-tf (Apache-2.0): GETTING-STARTED.md and trust-tasks-ts/README.md.

The `vta-buildathon:local` container image is built from the
verifiable-trust-infrastructure repository and is not distributed here.
